{"id":71359,"date":"2026-10-29T19:36:52","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:36:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71359"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:39:49","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:39:49","slug":"corrida-de-sao-silvestre-lamego","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-de-sao-silvestre-lamego\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre \u2013 Lamego 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre \u2013 Lamego 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre \u2013 Lamego 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Avenida Viscondes Guedes Teixeira<\/strong>, em pleno centro de <strong>Lamego<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>). Organizada conjuntamente pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Lamaecus D\u2019Ouro e pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lamego, a prova celebra a quadra natal\u00edcia num ambiente noturno vibrante pelas principais art\u00e9rias hist\u00f3ricas da cidade.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra duas vertentes adaptadas a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong>, desn\u00edvel positivo de <strong>130m D+<\/strong>, limite de 200 participantes e aberta a maiores de 16 anos) e a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s <strong>18:10<\/strong>, desn\u00edvel de <strong>70m D+<\/strong>, limite de 300 participantes e car\u00e1cter l\u00fadico aberto a todas as idades). Ambas as dist\u00e2ncias disp\u00f5em de um tempo limite de <strong>2h00<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a <strong>13 de dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23:59<\/strong>, com o valor \u00fanico de <strong>7,00 \u20ac<\/strong> na Corrida de 10 km e <strong>5,00 \u20ac<\/strong> na Caminhada de 5 km, incluindo seguro desportivo, dorsal, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha finisher. A prova de 10 km atribui trof\u00e9us e cart\u00f5es-oferta aos 3 primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos de cada escal\u00e3o (Sub23, Seniores, M\/F40, M\/F50 e M\/F60), com secretariado aberto das 16:30 \u00e0s 17:50 na partida e banhos nas Piscinas Municipais de Lamego. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida Viscondes Guedes Teixeira, Lamego, Viseu<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><s